{"schemaVersion":1,"year":2020,"currency":"USD","scope":"Total uncollected assessed contributions for current and prior years","source":{"symbol":"A/77/507","url":"https://unsceb.org/assets/media/reports/report-3755-A77507-Budgetary-and-financial-situation-of-the-organizations-of-the-UN-system-5-Oct-2022.pdf","sha256":"326102e613662476af1861987e322d1aabb35618aab1b82aa71cfa671ff138b3","table":7,"pdfPages":[140,141],"notes":[{"marker":"a","text":"The percentage collected as at 30 June and as at 31 December reflects the current fiscal year’s assessments.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020,2021]},{"marker":"b","text":"The amount outstanding reflects total uncollected assessments for all years (namely, current and prior).","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020,2021]},{"marker":"c","text":"New organizations reporting from 2017: CTBTO, ICC and UNFCCC; from 2018: IARC and OPCW; from 2019: ITLOS; and from 2021: ISA and UNCCD.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020,2021]},{"marker":"d","text":"UNFCCC has two budgets approved by the Conference of the Parties to the Convention; both are financed from indicative (assessed) contributions with different scales of assessment and different membership.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020,2021]},{"marker":"e","text":"UNWTO: The collection rate refers to assessed contributions from full members and associate members, excluding the collection rate of contributions from affiliate members.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020,2021]},{"marker":"f","text":"IARC: In 2021, there was an unbudgeted assessment from Hungary and China, amounting to 1.2 million euros, which is not reflected in the amount shown in the table. “Unbudgeted assessment” refers to an assessment on a new participating State that is not included in the regular budget.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2021]},{"marker":"g","text":"ICAO: The assessed voted data  received match the 100 per cent assessment but do not include the accounting adjustment of 2.8 million Canadian dollars.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020,2021]},{"marker":"h","text":"OPCW: The assessed contribution revenue includes an IPSAS adjustment for the estimated amount of liability, 0.3 million euros. This adjustment is not allocated by country.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020,2021]},{"marker":"i","text":"United Nations: The “assessed voted received percentage assessments” amount is based on the net amount assessed to Member States for the year 2020. It is the gross amount assessed to Member States (i.e. the gross amount approved by the General Assembly) less the approved staff assessment.","pdfPage":141,"years":[2020]}]},"organizations":[{"entity":"UN Secretariat","sourceEntity":"United Nations","sourceRow":1,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":807595757,"asOf":"2020-12-31","asOfBasis":"table_header","asOfSourcePdfPage":140,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2020-12-31","notes":[],"pdfPage":140,"rawOutstanding":"807 595 757"},{"entity":"Peacekeeping Operations","sourceEntity":"United Nations peacekeeping","sourceRow":2,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":2274041236,"asOf":null,"asOfBasis":"uncertain","asOfSourcePdfPage":140,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2020-12-31","notes":["The column heading gives 31 December, but the reporting date of this peacekeeping balance is not explicitly established by the table notes."],"pdfPage":140,"rawOutstanding":"2 274 041 236"},{"entity":"CTBTO","sourceEntity":"CTBTO","sourceRow":3,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":39325184,"asOf":"2020-12-31","asOfBasis":"table_header","asOfSourcePdfPage":140,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2020-12-31","notes":[],"pdfPage":140,"rawOutstanding":"39 325 184"},{"entity":"FAO","sourceEntity":"FAO","sourceRow":4,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":209031839,"asOf":"2020-12-31","asOfBasis":"table_header","asOfSourcePdfPage":140,"reportedHeaderAsOf":"2020-12-31","notes":[],"pdfPage":140,"rawOutstanding":"209 031 839"},{"entity":"IAEA","sourceEntity":"IAEA","sourceRow":5,"sourceRowOccurrence":1,"outstanding":80740735,"asOf":"2020-12-31","asOfBasis":"table_header","asOfSourcePdfPage":140,"